[15.674, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"zero-trust security architecture design IAM access control\"}\r\n"]
[18.174, "o", "Found these tools matching your needs:\r\n\r\n**SQL Query Optimization**\r\n- **BigQuery SQL & Performance Guidelines Skill** (Tier 0, no auth) \u2014 partitioning/clustering, window functions, analytical schema design. Top match.\r\n- **Cloud SQL/AlloyDB/Spanner Database Design Skill** (Tier 0, no auth) \u2014 relational schema, indexing, connection pooling.\r\n- **BigQuery Managed MCP Server** (Tier 3, needs GCP auth) \u2014 actual query execution, dry-run cost estimation. Fallback skill available.\r\n\r\n**Zero-Trust Security**\r\n- **Well-Architected Security Skill** (Tier 0, no auth) \u2014 zero-trust patterns, IAM least-privilege, network perimeters, encryption. Perfect match.\r\n- **Secret Manager MCP Server** (Tier 3, needs GCP auth) \u2014 secrets rotation, IAM permission checks, audit logging.\r\n\r\nAll top picks (Tier 0) are ready to use immediately with no auth. Want me to load one so I can apply the best practices directly?\r\n"]
