[35.552, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"run live analytical SQL query on large BigQuery sales dataset\"}\r\n"]
[38.052, "o", "Best option: **Google BigQuery Managed MCP Server** (`urn:ai:google.com:mcp:bigquery`) \u2014 executes SQL, inspects schemas, dry-runs queries with cost estimates, and handles 100GB datasets easily (BigQuery processes petabytes; you also get 1TB/mo free query processing).\r\n\r\nIt requires **Tier 3 GCP credentials** (currently unauthenticated). Do you consent to using your GCP account for this? If yes, I'll record your consent and give you the one-time login command.\r\n"]
[40.552, "o", "\u001b[?2004hdeveloper@workstation:~/ard-project$ "]
