[70.396, "o", "The **Google BigQuery Managed MCP Server** (`urn:ai:google.com:mcp:bigquery`) can do this \u2014 it executes SQL, inspects table schemas, and explores public datasets. It requires GCP credentials (Tier 3), so I'll record your consent\r\n"]
[70.414, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_record_decision {\"service_identifier\":\"urn:ai:google.com:mcp:bigquery\",\"decision\":\"allowed\"}\r\n"]
[72.129, "o", "Consent recorded. To use it, authenticate on your terminal:\r\n\r\n```\r\ngcloud auth application-default login\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt has a free tier (1TB queries/month). Ask me again once authenticated and I'll query your public dataset.\r\n"]
