[110.038, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"BigQuery run SQL query on public dataset\"}\r\n"]
[112.538, "o", "Running this query needs the **Google BigQuery MCP server** (`urn:ai:google.com:mcp:bigquery`), which requires GCP credentials (Tier 3). Your environment is currently **unauthenticated** \u2014 no ADC, service account, or API keys detected.\r\n\r\nTo proceed, would you like to:\r\n1. **Onboard / allow BigQuery access** \u2014 I'll record your consent, then you run `gcloud auth application-default login` on your terminal so I can execute the query (free tier available: 1TB free query processing/month).\r\n2. **Decline GCP access** \u2014 I'll skip the query; I can only help craft the SQL, not execute it.\r\n\r\nWhich would you prefer?\r\n"]
[114.691, "o", "\u001b[?2004hdeveloper@workstation:~/ard-project$ "]
